<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@/~cl_15> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 19a. Amendment of section 20a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@/~cl_16> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@> .
