<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@/~cl_7__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (8) the following subsection: “(8) The original proprietor who is guilty of an offence under subsection (7) shall, on conviction— (a) be liable to a fine of not less than ten thousand ringgit but not more than one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both and, in the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine of not less than one hundred ringgit but not more than one thousand ringgit for every day during which the offence continues to be committed; and (b) the court may order the original proprietor to apply for subdivision of building or land within a period specified in the order.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@> .
