<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@/~cl_7__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (8) the following subsection: “(9) For the purposes of paragraphs (2) (b), (c), (d) and (e), the date on which the building is or was completed shall be the date on which the certificate of completion and compliance is issued, certified by any local authority to be fit for occupation or use, or certified in accordance with the provisions of any written law for the time being in operation.”. Amendment of section 8a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/9/eng@> .
